OL,3,GNEWSAWe'll crumble when inquiry ends,
OL,4,Asays victim's mum
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mother of a student who was stabbed
OL,7,Fto death in the Nottingham attacks says
OL,8,Fshe might "crumble" when the public
OL,9,Finquiry examining the tragedy ends.
OL,11,FGrace O'Malley-Kumar, Barnaby Webber
OL,12,Fand Ian Coates were killed by Valdo
OL,13,FCalocane - who had been diagnosed with
OL,14,Fparanoid schizophrenia - on 13 June
OL,15,F2023.
OL,17,FOn Tuesday and Wednesday, the
OL,18,FNottingham Inquiry, which started
OL,19,Fhearing evidence in February, will hear
OL,20,Fclosing statements before a report of
OL,21,Ffindings is published.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,369,360,200,160,0,100
